{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"52a16d04b6930308","type":"text","text":"Stone King awakening triggers Ivys' defense, and activated Graveglass","x":420,"y":-120,"width":250,"height":160},
		{"id":"3db1e65bee7a9fa7","type":"text","text":"Graveglass within Ivys' fortress, studies the Stone King and Kairos, starts to agree with Kairos after seeing the state of the world post Reshaping","x":760,"y":-172,"width":250,"height":265},
		{"id":"90a30c984c7b764b","type":"text","text":"In anger Arzen is manipulated by Sathu-Dara. Arzen tells The Acolyte of Kasayt where to find Rowan and that Rowan his information on the Stone King","x":935,"y":137,"width":250,"height":298},
		{"id":"b49b2ab1b68f7db5","type":"text","text":"Arzen hunts for Emrys (doesn't know who Finch is), his lover which he calls Min Jadid, The Reborn","x":295,"y":186,"width":250,"height":199},
		{"id":"73650ea3ce1553b1","type":"text","text":"Arzen reaches out to Rowan (old friend) to ask bout Min Jadid, Rowan knows something but won't tell Arzen","x":615,"y":170,"width":250,"height":232},
		{"id":"f1ef9194173108be","type":"text","text":"Arzen finds ancient prison of Kronos beneath Walima, uses the power there to do the Sacrament of Oblivion","x":-15,"y":169,"width":250,"height":232},
		{"id":"b5ce14071fe893ae","type":"text","text":"The Acolyte (Hartwyn) / Cult of Kasayt hunt the Stone King to make Kasayt a new God using its demonic power","x":615,"y":-436,"width":250,"height":232},
		{"id":"835af6b23613d2f2","type":"text","text":"The Ur-Daraan make war on the Star-Elves, clashing for control of the Moon","x":670,"y":517,"width":232,"height":159},
		{"id":"4febdc7fdf1254f4","type":"text","text":"Orzul slays Nysria, ending the leaving all Star-Elves on Nysria dead.","x":1565,"y":516,"width":210,"height":160},
		{"id":"3e078e10f3ed678d","type":"text","text":"Cult of Kasayt Campaign begins here!","x":1740,"y":-555,"width":171,"height":119},
		{"id":"579accfe14ca0394","type":"text","text":"Graveglass and Arzen are connected by Sathu-Dara, making Arzen believe they were both contacted by Khal Daraan. Arzen travels to a Chronovault in Walima and meets with Graveglass","x":1740,"y":-100,"width":250,"height":364},
		{"id":"4c6ad9ceff6888fe","type":"text","text":"The Acolyte sends Sana to kill Rowan, and get the information on the Stone King","x":1360,"y":-575,"width":250,"height":160},
		{"id":"6ce3f167657f0da2","type":"text","text":"Graveglass and Arzen study Kairos's life together, and make a pact. Arzen gets time magic and Graveglass vows to work together to set the world back to the way it was supposed to be, and undo the Reshaping.","x":2080,"y":-50,"width":333,"height":265},
		{"id":"2430335d476d9207","type":"text","text":"Arzen goes to the Chronovault that holds the Bloodstone (in Escharra), also finds a shard of Kronos's prison","x":-645,"y":169,"width":235,"height":232},
		{"id":"4f89eaaea05622b1","type":"text","text":"Khal Daraan (through Sathu-Dara) whispers in Arzen's ear about the location of the Bloodstone, Arzen follows the visions","x":-960,"y":169,"width":250,"height":232},
		{"id":"7f0db8787407666f","type":"text","text":"Arzen's communion + Sacrament of Oblivion opens a rift in the Infinite Road, which the Ur-Daraan invade, ending up on the Moon Nysria","x":141,"y":480,"width":309,"height":232},
		{"id":"284c2a6b65bc9c1c","type":"text","text":"Sathu-Dara communes to Arzen secrets on how to see his true soul, plants seeds of Sacrament of Oblivion","x":-333,"y":319,"width":240,"height":232},
		{"id":"4cf17e5adf4f4cb3","type":"text","text":"Use of Bloodstone begins to awaken the Stone King, Acolyte gives Bloodstone to Sana Back-Sky","x":110,"y":-139,"width":250,"height":199},
		{"id":"9680041741273c90","type":"text","text":"Sathu-Dara builds Ur-Mesharan, The Spire of Whispers, a tower that was built by Ivys for Nysria, claimed by the Ur-Daraan. Her fortress where she projects her tricks and lies to the mortals of Terra-Oblivia","x":935,"y":676,"width":359,"height":232},
		{"id":"a49d6f0a367af4a1","type":"text","text":"Kasayt's soul is slowly fading as his cult shrinks, saved by Hartwyn who puts his essence in a magic orb (temporary solution as Kasayt dies slowly)","x":-660,"y":-232,"width":250,"height":265},
		{"id":"2cb939f002e0d161","type":"text","text":"Arzen gives fragment  of Prison + Bloodstone to Kasayt's Cult. Acolyte uses prison fragment to satbilize Kasayt's soul, and grants The Acolyte Kasayt's power.","x":-265,"y":-248,"width":250,"height":298},
		{"id":"c38f5bb94bac830d","type":"text","text":"Kasayt sealed (This was the first point in this note lol)","x":-1339,"y":-159,"width":220,"height":119},
		{"id":"5de36b5f08b9ac01","type":"text","text":"Bloodstone, Kairos's severed arm that was petrified but seperated from the Stone king Statue, is locked within Ivys's chronovault by Graveglass before he goes into statis to sleep","x":-1990,"y":120,"width":250,"height":331},
		{"id":"34c02a7bf2f17ec0","type":"text","text":"The Ur-Daraan are born, for thousands of years they war with all creations that have stopped existing. The devour and grow strong. They are trapped in the Deep with Khal Daraan, unable to escape","x":-2680,"y":480,"width":401,"height":232},
		{"id":"21c860d21ac0c0cf","type":"text","text":"Arzen is caught invoking Old Rites by Waliman priests, and is exiled to the desert + labeled a heretic.","x":1360,"y":120,"width":250,"height":199}
	],
